  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal multiprofile setups with scvi_n200 RNA encoder, resnet50 image encoder, avgpool aggregation, and weighted fusion (config_031) achieve the highest validation accuracy (0.6776). This experiment tests replacing the RNA encoder with scgpt and the image encoder with imagenet_vit_l while maintaining avgpool aggregation and weighted fusion. This clarifies whether combining scgpt with a stronger image encoder (imagenet_vit_l) could further improve performance, addressing uncertainty about encoder choices while building on the promising multiprofile multimodal direction."
}

